---
import SlipPage from "../components/SlipPage.astro";
---
<SlipPage kind="odds10" path="/10-odds-today" h1="10 odds today" card="10 odds slip"
          title="10 odds tips today: accumulator with the chance it lands"
          description="Today's 10 odds accumulator from our highest-probability priced selections, with 1xBet prices and the model's chance that every leg lands.">
  <p class="lede">An accumulator built from today's highest-probability priced selections (each rated 60% or more), one per match, until the 1xBet price reaches 10.00. The more legs, the lower the chance the whole slip lands, and we show that chance on every slip.</p>
</SlipPage>
